  "Description": "Does nothing. It only points out that, unlike meshes, images and other assets, audio files are added via the \"Playback Settings\".\n\nThis menu is opened with the gear icon in the timeline toolbar. It allows adding a project soundtrack (for example as an mp3 file) as well as live audio input devices.\n\nSee also: [AudioClip]",
